  "ingredients": [
    "1 (9 inch) pie crust, baked",
    "4 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "4 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "2.25 cups half-and-half cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dafP3d3hyWpcfMkMW1ZoI_QogM0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12301-sugar-cream-pie-i-VAT-005-step-01-2db5530ab79f419a903435cc6a9ba316.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12301/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cornstarch and sugar. Add 4 tablespoons butter and half and half. Cook over medium heat, stirring constantly, until mixture boils and becomes thick and creamy. Remove from heat and stir in the vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e61cH5NjoTYphfxV3I87hFvlj7A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12301-sugar-cream-pie-i-VAT-006-step-02-c5be40e6107446c48f38c56323bba2df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12301/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven broiler to high. Pour mixture into pie crust. Drizzle 2 tablespoons butter over top and sprinkle with cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0gOczxnG-ZWfwyN9drbmgSYZw7k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12301-sugar-cream-pie-i-VAT-007-step-03-09ed8d23b2e24ef08ad366df314490d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12301/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put under broiler until butter bubbles - watch it carefully as it doesn't take long.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-9BgmEsvvo3QZvVjOf63hVOy5O0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12301-sugar-cream-pie-i-VAT-008-step-04-f4c9db412eba48089a0e88040599a365.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12301/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate pie for at least 1 hour before serving.",
